  <item>
    <title>ep26 我女权，也追男明星</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a09d2c21b7bd5029552170d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a09d2c21b7bd5029552170d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 00:17:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本次节目邀请到小韩来聊聊，我们在女性意识觉醒前后如何追男明星，欢迎收听和讨论❤️</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="82">01:22</a> 小韩的追星经历：从王力宏意识到男性的帅</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="284">04:44</a> 追BIGBANG TOP，但当时就觉得他们不像好人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="523">08:43</a> 小韩因看演唱会脱粉王力宏：原来他不是天神；煎蛋去看曾经爱过的爱豆的live house却中途离场。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="912">15:12</a> 追BTS 田柾国，当过溺爱的妈粉，爱豆们不知何时能出头的拼劲最动人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1168">19:28</a> 选秀节目中，追星女为爱豆加了层层滤镜</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1315">21:55</a> 追seventeen 金明奎，妈粉加梦女；上头的同时也很清醒，“他只是让我开心的商品”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1669">27:49</a> 如何看待生活中“很装”的男生</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1787">29:47</a> 女性意识如何变清晰：杨笠“普信男”给模糊的感觉下定义，上野千鹤子《始于极限》令人意识到过去不舒适的原因；觉醒后如何追星</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2145">35:45</a> 一些站姐为何发现男偶像的问题还会捂嘴；女性真是太能忍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2587">43:07</a> 环大陆剧，到底是进一步给男性赋魅，还是女性凝视</span></p><hr><p><span>主播：小韩、煎蛋</span></p><p><span>剪辑：煎蛋</span></p><p><span>BGM：BIGBANG - BAD BOY</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62ce57c964f141ad815011a7/lj_tR9nVN8UfpXHuy1akwydd4kGI.m4a" length="46489279" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:51</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp41R46QP2ioo9np9ztLovDPAjhk.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>ep25 从13岁到30岁，我们反复爱上《花样男子》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68dd37348bf86095c58026aa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68dd37348bf86095c58026aa</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 01 Oct 2025 14:18:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>前段时间在濑户内旅游时，我们突然打开了日版《花样男子》。同时打开的，还有久违的青春期心动💓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="46">00:46</a> 为什么会看日版《花样男子》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="231">03:51</a> 道明寺司：怎么会爱上非主流超雄男</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a> 牧野杉菜：了不起的顽强女主，家庭设定奇葩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="525">08:45</a> 花泽类：谁都会爱温柔男二吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">09:55</a> 道明寺vs花泽类</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">15:10</a> 道明寺椿：支持自由恋爱的金丝雀姐姐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1002">16:42</a> 大河原滋：竟然不是绿茶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1189">19:49</a> 藤堂静：role model</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1318">21:58</a> 道明寺枫：不完全是恶婆婆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1458">24:18</a> 西门总二郎：日出告白与一期一会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1608">26:48</a> 美作玲：简述演员阿部力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1684">28:04</a> 配角们：抽象樱子，不知作用的生田斗真出演的角色，西田，健哥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1936">32:16</a> 从校园到社会，第二季太虐了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2114">35:14</a> 小时候看过的偶像剧：灰姑娘类-《天国的嫁衣》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2249">37:29</a> 女主成长类-《我可能不会爱你》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2524">42:04</a> 灰姑娘类vs现实类，那种更有代入感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2614">43:34</a> 青春校园类与逆后宫类偶像剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2866">47:46</a> 喜欢与爱的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span>----</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：煎蛋，吉伊妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：煎蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：Love so sweet-岚，Cloudy noon-山下康介</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62ce57c964f141ad815011a7/lrFvPd7DnBXmkjK3W9eqM4vyM1o4.m4a" length="51000777" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:52:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpVgEj_ybjKNttx4FIVhu3-mDwz-.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>ep24 她的月亮与六便士：那些作为偶像练习生的日子</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68c43722a56ca3e0c41d748a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68c43722a56ca3e0c41d748a</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 12 Sep 2025 15:11:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>七七是创意写作专业的学生，也曾是国内一家娱乐公司的练习生。本期节目，她将聊聊那些为了出道而努力的日子。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="13">00:13</a> 七七的自我介绍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="97">01:37</a> 喜欢跳舞，成为练习生之前，在上海参加SM等韩娱公司的选秀</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">08:10</a> 高中毕业后和某公司签约，成为练习生</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="542">09:02</a> 曾经的体育老师在同一家公司成为演员出道了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="734">12:14</a> 练习生的日常训练与商演机会</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="899">14:59</a> 练习生的收入模式</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="958">15:58</a> 和同期生的交流与相处</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1118">18:38</a> 练习结束后的出道模式</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1297">21:37</a> 想吐槽的事：训练与当队长的累</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1526">25:26</a> 男女练习生的恋爱纠葛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1791">29:51</a> 从练习生时期培养“大粉”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1923">32:03</a> 私联的男练习生，爱豆是否要会“媚粉”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2216">36:56</a> 努力的前香蕉娱乐练习生，练舞蹈凌晨三四点</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2427">40:27</a> 遗憾的事：曾共同追梦的朋友已经结婚生子</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2590">43:10</a> 为什么最后没有成功出道</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2891">48:11</a> 从练习生转成创意写作研究生的经历</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3116">51:56</a> 对明星/网红/偶像职业的看法</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3219">53:39</a> 对想成为练习生的孩子们的建议</span></p><p><span>----</span></p><p><span>嘉宾：七七（抖音：同济研究生的爱豆日常）</span></p><p><span>主播：煎蛋</span></p><p><span>BGM：月亮與六便士(달과 6펜스) - 沈圭善(Lucia)</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62ce57c964f141ad815011a7/lrL-uX6EQ5yUEYXdawMn-vLzBnHB.m4a" length="56011171" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:53</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FumlLTp_ujYVn1n97SBZ-4jQ8yTl.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>ep23 濑户内海之很高兴你也喜欢艺术</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68b949fe5faf368659fd3cd7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68b949fe5faf368659fd3cd7</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 05 Sep 2025 00:47:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>八月的最后几天，我和朋友参观了濑户内海艺术祭2025夏季展会。</span></p><p><span>虽然出发前天气预报一直有雨，但每天早上拉开窗帘，阳光都刺得人睁不开眼。于是我们顶着烈日，在三十五度高温中热气腾腾地跳岛，感受艺术的熏陶。</span></p><p><span>虽然我们并不懂艺术，对作品的理解十分主观，但聊到后面，竟有些意想不到的感悟。</span></p><p><span>希望你也喜欢艺术，并有自己的见解～</span></p><p><span>P.s.濑户内海艺术祭秋季展会时间10.3-11.9，天气很适合出行旅游</span></p><p><span>-----</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7">00:07</a> 我们对濑户内海艺术祭的印象——原来不是小众活动啊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="147">02:27</a> 行程：Day1-大阪花火大会，Day2-四国水族馆，Day3-志度/津田/引田，Day4-男木岛/女木岛，Day5-丰岛，Day6&amp;7-直岛，Day8-高松</span></p><h2><span>印象深刻的作品/经历</span></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="247">04:07</a> 丰岛美术馆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="625">10:25</a> 志度：Echos as Air Flows</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="751">12:31</a> 女木岛：小学校</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="914">15:14</a> 男木岛：长寿啤酒</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1034">17:14</a> 直岛：家计划-南寺</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1501">25:01</a> 在直岛被和当地初中生练英语口语，在高松栗林公园参加高中生游园会</span></p><h2><span>其他行程与讨论</span></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 津田“与时间对话”，坐电车被罚款，志度居民与名人，引田的手套产业</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2133">35:33</a> 在地艺术与文创发展</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2248">37:28</a> 艺术的个人表达：女木岛电影院，直岛钱汤</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2454">40:54</a> 作品速览：男木岛夕阳与猫之家，直岛新美术馆蔡国强作品，时间回廊吴青峰同款照，安藤忠雄的设计，烈日下与草间弥生黄南瓜拍照</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2844">47:24</a> 食物：骨付鸡，乌冬面，柠檬</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2956">49:16</a> 由濑户内海工业污染聊到金塘岛水獭；少子化导致消失的故乡；</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3189">53:09</a> 聊到国内艺术节，“看展女孩消失在朋友圈”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3406">56:46</a> 结合当地文化做设计的项目实践，局限与期待</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3999">1:06:39</a> 小声推荐宝藏小城高松</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4130">1:08:50</a> 旅行带来的非日常感与一直在路上的动荡感</span></p><h2><span>一些旅行实拍</span></h2><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp3gHrgfb5ycuilYh58dYcKPTFTr.JPG"></figure><p><span>⬆️丰岛美术馆外景</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpa7xYwJzndhEtQKT7imv1TeeM1e.jpg"></figure><p><span>⬆️女木岛小学校</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsb3NAIAk3AIILUp2gWkTzW9iZYe.JPG"></figure><p><span>⬆️志度Echos as Air Flows</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhDwAUj6EkhwxBg-3L3nWiCF4bNx.JPG"></figure><p><span>⬆️直岛家计划作品之一</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FianM_BDaLwcKQajjYtrb9i_HWhM.jpg"></figure><p><span>⬆️直岛时间回廊-吴青峰同款照</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsKU5XjSqiq0LGrfjbz1YJPnI8XL.jpg"></figure><p><span>⬆️栗林公园偶入中学生活动</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkp8Yl_iydolbwERXWk3cfOjHRT6.JPG"></figure><p><span>⬆️乌冬面、荞麦面</span></p><p><span>-----</span></p><p><span>主播：煎蛋、吉伊妈妈</span></p><p><span>剪辑：煎蛋</span></p><p><span>BGM：飞鱼-苏打绿</span></p>]]></description>
