    <pubDate>Thu, 18 Apr 2024 14:24:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>带你嗑着cp无痛入门F1！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="113">00:01:53</a> F1是什么，舒马赫与法拉利</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="293">00:04:53</a> 饮料厂也能参加F1?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="478">00:07:58</a> 比赛怎么看：排位赛、冲刺赛、正赛；换胎与进站策略，DRS，安全车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1092">00:18:12</a> 法拉利=SM 梅奔=JYP 红牛=Hybe；一号车手与二号车手的微妙关系；维斯塔潘，佩雷兹，2021阿布扎比争议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1727">00:28:47</a> 梅奔，汉米尔顿和他的队友们：拉塞尔、博塔斯、罗斯伯格。嗑一口Broced</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2202">00:36:42</a> 法拉利，勒克莱尔是美强惨吗，边上班边找工作的赛恩斯。维斯塔潘受害者、中国女婿阿尔本，为法兰西卖腐的奥康和加斯利</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2632">00:43:52</a> 迈凯伦，诺里斯与皮亚斯特里，阿斯顿马丁的爸爸钞能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2883">00:48:03</a> 维特尔CP专场，恋爱只谈世界冠军（机长特例）：Simi，Martian， Sewis， Sico，335，（居然漏下了Sebson我有罪啊！！跪下了！）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3394">00:56:34</a> 小声说法拉利坏话</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpgmb9HQoPBPbbyk1OzObWayOT92.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>图：苦苦等待的铁佛寺</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：Nanami，煎蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：Nanami</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：Formula 1 Theme</span></p>]]></description>
