    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">00:58</a> 最早接触到的AI工具：ChatGPT，Disco Diffusion</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="227">03:47</a> 用ChatGPT写同人文</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="344">05:44</a> 用ChatGPT写生活中的“废话”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="439">07:19</a> 用elevenlabs做AI同人音频：新世界的大门打开了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="804">13:24</a> 用Midjourney画灌篮高手同人图</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a> 用AI写小说：AI只是工具，而创作饱含感情与细节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1315">21:55</a> 用Suno为小说里的角色写歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1434">23:54</a> 剪映中的高效AI小工具</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1478">24:38</a> ChatGPT DAN模式：cos限制级乙游角色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1541">25:41</a> 工作中的应用：GPT-多功能小秘书，Pi-高情商面试助手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1749">29:09</a> 负面影响：AI画画抄袭问题，AI是否影响创作质量，被AI污染的知识库</span></p><span></span><p><span>以上仅代表主播观点，欢迎理讨👏</span></p><span></span><p><span>------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：煎蛋、Nanami</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：煎蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：彗星（词：煎蛋，曲：Suno）</span></p>]]></description>
