  <item>
    <title>ep17 简评披哥3: 到底谁在披荆斩棘</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65532d8ed0028fb4cb3b2236</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65532d8ed0028fb4cb3b2236</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 Nov 2023 12:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>⚠️节目仅代表主播观点，不喜欢请及时关闭（建议张远粉丝别听）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a> 看节目的契机与整体感受</span></p><h2><span>简评哥哥</span></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="193">03:13</a> 陈楚生：不愧是（王栎鑫永远的）大哥</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">07:40</a> 张远：不合时宜？用力过猛？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="781">13:01</a> 俞灏明：曾经真的帅，但请继续演戏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="932">15:32</a> Jeff罗杰夫：真人秀最重要的是展现人的美好品格吧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1172">19:32</a> 林志颖：儿时偶像，F1车迷</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1248">20:48</a> 蔡国庆：精神状态遥遥领先</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1385">23:05</a> 李玖哲：又惨又好笑的韩国人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1502">25:02</a> 宝石Gem：亲切的兄弟的兄弟</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1629">27:09</a> 王耀庆-你的唱跳我忍很久了；何展成&amp;马晓龙-舞担的存在感，综艺还是别苦情</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1834">30:34</a> 张栋梁-又甜又温柔，魏哲鸣-Nanami的山东老乡，马伯骞-还以为你是走后门进来的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2121">35:21</a> 阿璞&amp;瘦子E.SO：职场好人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2136">35:36</a> 胡彦斌：KPI你认真的吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2246">37:26</a> 弹壳、陆毅、伯远-从青你1到披哥3、关智斌-42岁的可爱男人、唐禹哲-被起哄求婚真是太惨了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2533">42:13</a> 被淘汰的哥哥们：许绍洋、蓝正龙、魏巡</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2687">44:47</a> 煎蛋最爱的瘦子E.SO</span></p><h2><span>简评舞台</span></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2737">45:37</a> 一公：《没时间后悔》《上山下》《眉飞色舞》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2784">46:24</a> 二公：《行走的鱼》《我恨我痴心》《调查中》《伶人》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2875">47:55</a> 三公：都很难评，形式大于内容</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3024">50:24</a> 四公：《光明》《饿狼传说》《第一次做人》《东海老人》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3140">52:20</a> 五公：《落叶归根》《逆战》《麒麟》《他不爱我》《动物世界》《漂洋过海来看你》《违背的青春》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3314">55:14</a> 总决赛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3403">56:43</a> 今年最无聊的综艺终于结束了（bushi），但还是有选秀带来的感动</span></p><p><span>-------</span></p><p><span>主播：煎蛋、Nanami</span></p><p><span>剪辑：煎蛋</span></p><p><span>BGM：披荆斩棘</span></p>]]></description>
