    <title>ep15 同人女拯救世界</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64e9d82780c9ec4c5f548793</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64e9d82780c9ec4c5f548793</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 26 Aug 2023 10:47:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">00:15</a> 我们在同人领域的背景与经历：煎蛋—围观路人；Nanami-产出丰富、几乎成主业的资深玩家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="329">05:29</a> 我们在哪里看：Lofter—曾经辉煌、日渐萧条，微博—大而杂且易被审判，豆瓣—年轻的氛围，bilibili—当前主要经营的场所</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="853">14:13</a> 我们看什么：入坑《全职高手》的cosplay与同人文，《排球少年》影山同人图，cp视频，AI制作音频与《魔道祖师》同人歌曲；多说两句：阿杰与边江</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1309">21:49</a> 浅聊印象深刻的作品：F1同人文为什么好；名篇《下坠》；凯源同人文名段；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1803">30:03</a> 同人产出的普适性与创新性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1935">32:15</a> 从对cp角色偏爱程度聊同人女的类型</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2176">36:16</a> 逆cp真的不可以吗？不同性别的cp里情感的平等性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2504">41:44</a> 与同担交流的苦与乐，产出后得到反馈真的很重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2874">47:54</a> 一些讨论：同人vs原创，真人vs二次元</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3416">56:56</a> 结尾：多多包涵</span></p><span></span><p><span>---------</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：煎蛋、Nanami</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：煎蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：同道殊途-《魔道祖师》同人歌</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：由Nanami精心PS的JeffBible同人图</span></p>]]></description>
