    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="39">00:39</a> 煎蛋和nanami的韩娱追星背景 - 四五代女团、东方神起、Super Junior、Wanna One、2PM、Seventeen</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="236">03:56</a> 《Boys Planet 999》 - 选手不抢眼，节目剪辑乱，卖腐打咩，从期待到放弃；101系选秀路在何方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="519">08:39</a> 声名远扬的《雾都雾里七个八》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="576">09:36</a> 《Peak Time》- 选秀黑马？糊团回春？二代团粉丝怀旧盛宴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 催人泪下打工组Vanner - 为梦想拼搏，Seventeen不是想唱就能唱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="939">15:39</a> 绝美vocal双人组MASC - 哟不塞哟无限循环，NU’EST的氛围感，Super Junior乱入</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1292">21:32</a> 开口跪大国男儿 - 爷青回，或许是最会翻唱东方神起的组合</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1499">24:59</a> 掌控舞台M.O.N.T - 空气，他加入了空气！比JYP唱得还好的主唱和天才rapper</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1600">26:40</a> 选秀路在何方 - 聚是一团火散是满天星根本不存在；对101系感到疲惫；要实力也要情怀</span></p><span></span><p><span>----------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：煎蛋、Nanami</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：Nanami</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sorry Sorry - Super Junior</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hot - 杨钧 王颜宏</span></p><span></span><p><span>Adore U (珍爱）- Vanner</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hello - MASC</span></p><span></span><p><span>Mirotic（咒文）- 大国男儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>Fever - M.O.N.T</span></p>]]></description>
